{#-
  luademo.tmpl - Live demonstration of user-defined Lua filters.

  The shortcode body is piped through reverse_title_case from the
  site's own filters/docs.lua, so the Lua Filters documentation page
  shows the feature running for real. Pass the sample text as the
  shortcode body. Site-level script and shortcode: not shipped to
  new sites.

  Note: keep literal brace-tag examples out of Crinja comments; its
  lexer does not shield them.
-#}
<p>
  <code>{{ inner }}</code> becomes
  <code>{{ inner | reverse_title_case }}</code>
</p>
